### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "tester",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "테스터",
  "agreeTerms": true,
  "agreePrivacy": true,
  "ageConfirmed": true
}

### 로그인 (응답의 accessToken을 아래 @token에 복사)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "tester",
  "password": "1234"
}

### ====== 이하 요청은 Bearer 토큰 필요 ======
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 내 정보
GET http://localhost:8080/api/member/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 세팅 옵션 (장비/스킬/유물 + 예산)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 새 게임 시작 (기본 장비 + 기본 공격만)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/new
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "difficulty": "NORMAL",
  "weaponId": null,
  "armorId": null,
  "helmetId": null,
  "skillIds": [],
  "relicIds": []
}

### 현재 게임 뷰
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 다음 노드 전진 (AI가 전투/조우 생성)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/next
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 스킬 사용 (slotId는 current 응답의 skillSlotDTO에서 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/battle/skill
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "slotId": 1,
  "targetKeys": [0]
}

### 조우 선택
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/encounter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "choiceIndex": 0
}

### 보상 스킵 -> 상점 오픈
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/reward
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "itemType": "SKIP",
  "itemId": null
}

### 상점 조회 / 나가기
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 상점 나가기
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/shop/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 게임 종료 요약
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 랭킹
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ranking?difficulty=NORMAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 도감
GET http://localhost:8080/api/collection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 가이드 챗봇
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "핏빛 반지랑 시너지 좋은 스킬 알려줘"
}
